      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Douglas_Flat%2C_California"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Douglas Flat was a roaring mining camp in the early 1850s, producing $130,000 in gold by 1857.",
