      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Douglas_Flat%2C_California"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Most long‑term settlers came from Wales and Italy, while early farmers were from the eastern United States.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
